SUMMARY:An Evening of Storytelling with Malcolm Gladwell
LOCATION:Audible's Minetta Lane Theatre\, Greenwich Village
DESCRIPTION:The American Way of Killing: An Evening of Storytelling with Ma
 
lcolm Gladwell Join bestselling author and one of the most original thinker
 
s of our time\, Malcolm Gladwell\, at Audible's Minetta Lane Theatre for Th
 
e American Way of Killing: An Evening of Storytelling with Malcolm Gladwell
 
 - a special one-night-only event inspired by his latest book\, The America
 
n Way of Killing: The Invention of an Epidemic. Hear Gladwell share from hi
 
s provocative new investigation into America's gun violence epidemic\, brin
 
ging his trademark curiosity and unexpected perspective to one of the count
 
ry's most urgent issues. Don't miss this exclusive evening\, Sunday\, Octob
 
er 25 at 8:00 PM. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/an-evening-o
 
