DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T130000
SUMMARY:Grave Beginnings: Green-Wood By Trolley
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>Discover Green-Wood\\'s stunning landscape and remarkable hi
 
story on this free hour-long trolley tour. Perfect for first-time visitors\
 
, this accessible introduction takes you on a leisurely ride to hear about 
 
notable residents\, including Auguste Renouard\, the “Father of modern da
 
y embalming”\; indu Tickets & info: https://www.green-wood.com/event/grav
 
e-beginnings-green-wood-by-trolley-7/
URL:https://www.green-wood.com/event/grave-beginnings-green-wood-by-trolley
 
-7/
END:VEVENT
