DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T140000
SUMMARY:Rest in Pace
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join Green-Wood\\'s leisurely walking group\, Rest in Pace. 
 
This welcoming gathering is designed for anyone who loves a good stroll and
 
 even better company. Together\, we\\'ll meander through the Cemetery\\'s s
 
cenic paths at a comfortable pace\, taking in beautiful views\, discovering
 
 fascinating storie Tickets & info: https://www.green-wood.com/event/rest-i
 
n-pace-green-house-2/2026-10-25/
URL:https://www.green-wood.com/event/rest-in-pace-green-house-2/2026-10-25/
