DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T150000
SUMMARY:Green-Wood’s Greatest Hits
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>After you’ve devoured some turkey and stuffed yourself wit
 
h pumpkin pie\, escape from the house—especially if you need a break from
 
 your guests—and enjoy a walking tour of Green-Wood. Or if the whole fami
 
ly is still getting along\, bring everyone! </p>\\n Tickets & info: https:/
 
/www.eventbrite.com/e/green-woods-greatest-hits-tickets-1979611809211
