DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T161500
SUMMARY:Cemetery Scavenger Hunt
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>We are pleased to announce that this year\, we are official 
 
partners of TalkDeath’s 5th Annual 2025 Halloween Cemetery Scavenger Hunt
 
. Taking place every Halloween weekend\, TalkDeath’s Cemetery Scavenger H
 
unt is an annual event designed to bring together communities\, families\, 
 
cemetery lovers\, and Tickets & info: https://www.green-wood.com/event/ceme
 
tery-scavenger-hunt/
URL:https://www.green-wood.com/event/cemetery-scavenger-hunt/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261025-176@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261025T060358Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T190000
SUMMARY:Green-Wood After Hours
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>The dead don\\'t keep visiting hours\, but we do! Join us af
 
ter dark for a walk through Green-Wood\\'s history\, legends\, and secrets.
 
 And before you depart\, step inside the Catacombs\, a space that is normal
 
